{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0b91437a-4171-86e4-b90c-6bd66566f866",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T10:00:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rui Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:58:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:58:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. My name is Rui Souza. I, um... [pause] I have a lot of branches in my yard. From the, the wind we had. And leaves, and some small sticks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:58:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Souza, so yard waste and branches. Are they on the ground, or is anything still hanging up there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:58:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, all on the ground. Just in the yard. [pause] Nothing fell on anything. I just want to know when the brush pickup is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:58:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me pull that up. Are you on a Thursday route, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:59:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. [pause] I put the barrels out on, on Mondays, I think. Yes, Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:59:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Monday trash, I'm writing that down. Brush pickup is a separate schedule, so I'd want to confirm which week for your street. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:59:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-oh. Good. And what's the best way to bundle it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is the other thing. How do I, how do I tie it? [pause] Sorry, I had a thought. My sweater, my favorite one, it came back from the cleaners today. I was thinking, I do not want to get it dirty in the yard. [pause] So, the bundling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:59:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, keep that sweater clean. Generally you tie the branches in bundles with twine, not wire, and keep them fairly short so one person can lift them. Cut them to about four feet or so, and stack them neatly at the curb. Loose leaves go in paper yard bags."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:59:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twine. Four feet. Paper bags for the leaves. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T09:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. I'll have someone confirm your pickup week and call you back at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:00:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
